), and number of DRAM module vary depending on the CPU and memory configuration, for more information refer to www.asus.com for<br />memory support list.<br />* Non-ECC, Un-buffered DDR5 Memory supports On-Die ECC function.</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"productSpec\"><div class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__productSpecItemRow__FIQRs\" style=\"display:;\"><h2 id=\"spec3\" class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__productSpecItemTitle__SQKkN\"><p>Đồ họa</p></h2> <div class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__productSpecItemContent__KGdVK\"><div class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__productSpecListItem__sNNrC\"><span class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__descriptionItem__dyUex\" style=\"display:none;\"></span> <span class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__descriptionItemValue__0ezBw\" style=\"display:;\">2 x USB4® ports support USB Type-C® display outputs*<br />* VGA resolution support depends on processors' or graphic cards' resolution.</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"productSpec\"><div class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__productSpecItemRow__FIQRs\" style=\"display:;\"><h2 id=\"spec4\" class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__productSpecItemTitle__SQKkN\"><p>Khe cắm mở rộng</p></h2> <div class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__productSpecItemContent__KGdVK\"><div class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__productSpecListItem__sNNrC\"><span class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__descriptionItem__dyUex\" style=\"display:none;\"></span> <span class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__descriptionItemValue__0ezBw\" style=\"display:;\"><strong>AMD Ryzen™ 9000 & 7000 Series Desktop Processors</strong><br />2 x PCIe 5.0 x16 slots (supports x16 or x8/x8 modes)*<br />*When the PCIe 5.0 M.2 card is installed on the PCIEX16(G5)_2, PCIEX16(G5)_1 will run x8 only. <br />*When M.2_2 is enabled, PCIEX16(G5)_1 will run x8 and PCIEX16(G5)_2 will run x4.<br /><strong>AMD Ryzen™ 8700/8600 Series Desktop Processors</strong><br />2 x PCIe 4.0 x16 slots (only supports PCIEx16_1 & total bandwidth for x8, PCIEx16_2 will be disabled)<br /><strong>AMD Ryzen™ 8500/8300 Series Desktop Processors</strong><br />2 x PCIe 4.0 x16 slots (only supports PCIEx16_1 & total bandwidth for x4, PCIEx16_2 will be disabled)<br /><strong>AMD X670 Chipset</strong><br />1 x PCIe 4.0 x4 slot</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"productSpec\"><div class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__productSpecItemRow__FIQRs\" style=\"display:;\"><h2 id=\"spec5\" class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__productSpecItemTitle__SQKkN\"><p>Lưu trữ</p></h2> <div class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__productSpecItemContent__KGdVK\"><div class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__productSpecListItem__sNNrC\"><span class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__descriptionItem__dyUex\" style=\"display:none;\"></span> <span class=\"WhereToBuySingleItem__descriptionItemValue__0ezBw\" style=\"display:;\"><strong>Total supports 5 x M.2 slots and 6 x SATA 6Gb/s ports*<br />AMD Ryzen™ 9000 / 8000 / 7000 Series Desktop Processors</strong><br />M.2_1 slot (Key M), type 2242/2260/2280<br />- AMD Ryzen™ 9000 & 7000 Series Desktop Processors support PCIe 5.0 x4 mode<br />- AMD Ryzen™ 8000 Series Desktop Processors support PCIe 4.0 x4 mode<br />M.2_2 slot (Key M), type 2242/2260/2280<br />- Only AMD Ryzen™ 9000 & 7000 Series Desktop Processors support PCIe 5.0 x4 mode<br />- AMD Ryzen™ 8700/8600 Series Desktop Processors support PCIe 4.0 x4 mode<br />- AMD Ryzen™ 8500/8300 Series Desktop Processors support PCIe 4.0 x2 mode<br />GEN-Z.2_1 slot (Key M) via ROG GEN-Z.2, type 2242/2260/2280/22110<br />- AMD Ryzen™ 9000 & 7000 Series Desktop Processors support PCIe 5.0 x4 mode<br />- AMD Ryzen™ 8700/8600 Series Desktop Processors support PCIe 4.0 x4 mode<br />- AMD Ryzen™ 8500/8300 Series Desktop Processors support PCIe 4.0 x2 mode<br />PCIe 5.0 M.2 slot (Key M) via PCIe 5.0 M.2 card, type 2242/2260/2280/22110 (supports PCIe 5.0 x4 mode)<br />- AMD Ryzen™  9000 & 7000 Series Desktop Processors support PCIe 5.0 x4 mode<br />- AMD Ryzen™ 8000 Series Desktop Processors support PCIe 4.0 x4 mode<br /><strong>AMD X670 Chipset</strong><br />GEN-Z.2_2 slot (Key M) 